{"video":"qQwoFaHTpY8","lines":[{"t":[0,2.4],"en":"-There are 13 people working in this office."},{"t":[2.4,7.3],"en":"So 13 times a year, Michael gets a cake and balloons"},{"t":[7.3,11.2],"en":"and some sort of joke gift and makes a toast."},{"t":[11.2,12.5],"en":"And there are two types of toasts."},{"t":[12.5,15.4],"en":"One is a joke about how old you are."},{"t":[15.4,16.9],"en":"-Look at those wrinkles."},{"t":[16.9,19.6],"en":"Blacks do crack, not crack the drug."},{"t":[19.6,24],"en":"-And the other is something inappropriate or horrible."},{"t":[24,25.7],"en":"Or both."},{"t":[25.7,26.6],"en":"What else?"},{"t":[26.6,28.5],"en":"He only sings the high harmony to \"Happy Birthday.\""},{"t":[30,33.9],"en":"-And he is a very big believer in surprise parties."},{"t":[33.9,36.5],"en":"Maybe even, arguably, possibly to a fault."},{"t":[36.5,37.6],"en":"-Happy Birthday!"},{"t":[37.6,39.1],"en":"-Happy Birthday!"},{"t":[39.1,41.9],"en":"-"},{"t":[41.9,43.9],"en":"-Happy Birthday!"},{"t":[43.9,47.3],"en":"-So I think, yeah, I think getting these out of the way"},{"t":[47.3,49.6],"en":"might be productive."},{"t":[49.6,52.5],"en":"-We can just have one big, fun party."},{"t":[52.5,55],"en":"And everybody's happy, and nobody wastes their time."},{"t":[55,56.5],"en":"-I don't like it."},{"t":[60,64.6],"en":"-Wow, you're shaking things up a bit, huh?"},{"t":[64.6,66.5],"en":"-It's a pretty good idea, don't you think?"},{"t":[66.5,67.6],"en":"-Do you think it's a good idea?"},{"t":[67.6,68.8],"en":"-No."},{"t":[68.8,71.2],"en":"I think it's a great idea."},{"t":[71.2,73.6],"en":"-Hmm."},{"t":[73.6,76.7],"en":"-You know, try sending him another invoice."},{"t":[76.7,77.5],"en":"-Okay."},{"t":[77.5,78.5],"en":"-Alright."},{"t":[78.5,81],"en":"Oh, did you see my memo, by the way?"},{"t":[81,85.2],"en":"-Let's be honest, as fun as birthdays are,"},{"t":[85.2,87.1],"en":"we all could use a break from the constant cake,"},{"t":[87.1,91.1],"en":"so let's celebrate birthday month in style today."},{"t":[91.1,94.1],"en":"This is really cool."},{"t":[94.1,95],"en":"Right?"},{"t":[95,96.5],"en":"-I was just thinking that--"},{"t":[96.5,98.5],"en":"-No, totally, totally."},{"t":[98.5,100.3],"en":"This way we get it all out of the way at once,"},{"t":[100.3,102.1],"en":"and it could actually be fun."},{"t":[102.1,103.4],"en":"-Right."},{"t":[103.4,106.2],"en":"-Exactly."},{"t":[106.2,109.5],"en":"I knew I could count on you."},{"t":[109.5,112],"en":"-Hey, Jim, can I have my own cake?"},{"t":[112,112.9],"en":"-What's that?"},{"t":[112.9,114.5],"en":"-I really prefer devil's food cake."},{"t":[114.5,115.8],"en":"-Oh, sure."},{"t":[115.8,117.1],"en":"-Yes. -Okay."},{"t":[117.1,119.5],"en":"-Wow, that was easy."},{"t":[119.5,121.4],"en":"-Yeah, people like me, I guess."},{"t":[121.4,123.4],"en":"-Jim!"},{"t":[123.4,124.4],"en":"-I hate devil's food."},{"t":[124.4,125.5],"en":"-Well, I think Meredith was--"},{"t":[125.5,126.4],"en":"-Screw it, Meredith."},{"t":[126.4,127.9],"en":"I don't think it's fair to let someone else"},{"t":[127.9,129.3],"en":"pick the cake on my birthday."},{"t":[129.3,130.1],"en":"-Everybody's birthday."},{"t":[130.1,131.5],"en":"-Today is actually my birthday,"},{"t":[131.5,133.4],"en":"and I want to pick the cake."},{"t":[133.4,134.4],"en":"-What do you want?"},{"t":[134.4,135.4],"en":"-I want pie, I want peach pie."},{"t":[135.4,136],"en":"-I want birthday pie."},{"t":[136,137],"en":"-I want a nice cobbler."},{"t":[137,138],"en":"-Well, I'm gonna talk to Angela,"},{"t":[138,139.1],"en":"and we're gonna see what we can do about a pie."},{"t":[139.1,140.3],"en":"-I don't care who you talk to."},{"t":[140.3,141.1],"en":"Just make it happen."},{"t":[141.1,141.9],"en":"-It'll be Angela."},{"t":[141.9,143.4],"en":"-You tell her it's for Creed."},{"t":[143.4,144.6],"en":"She'll know what that means."},{"t":[148.6,149.7],"en":"-Hey, Jim."},{"t":[149.7,150.9],"en":"-Toby."},{"t":[150.9,153.3],"en":"-Hey, I just got the word on the communal birthday."},{"t":[153.3,157.1],"en":"It's a great idea."},{"t":[157.1,158.3],"en":"-Oh, thanks, man."},{"t":[158.3,160.3],"en":"-Yeah."},{"t":[160.3,163.1],"en":"Wow."},{"t":[163.1,164.1],"en":"Is there anything I can--"},{"t":[164.1,166.3],"en":"-My birthday was two months ago."},{"t":[166.3,167.5],"en":"-Oh, OK."},{"t":[167.5,169.1],"en":"-There was no party."},{"t":[169.1,169.6],"en":"-What?"},{"t":[169.6,171.2],"en":"-Well, there was."},{"t":[171.2,175.3],"en":"But Michael scheduled it for 4:58 on a Friday."},{"t":[175.3,177],"en":"You know, people sang in the parking lot."},{"t":[177,178.3],"en":"-Mm, I remember that."},{"t":[178.3,181.6],"en":"-I don't know, I just thought maybe it could include me."},{"t":[181.6,182.1],"en":"-Seriously?"},{"t":[182.1,183.3],"en":"-I just thought you had me in,"},{"t":[183.3,185.5],"en":"and I don't know what the harm in that is."},{"t":[185.5,186.6],"en":"-Toby's great."},{"t":[186.6,187.4],"en":"He's great."},{"t":[187.4,189.9],"en":"But sometimes he can be a little bit much."},{"t":[189.9,191.4],"en":"I don't see any harm in that."},{"t":[191.4,192.8],"en":"-Well, it's a cake, Toby."},{"t":[192.8,195],"en":"So come on."},{"t":[195,196.1],"en":"-OK, yeah, you know what?"},{"t":[196.1,197.1],"en":"We're just going to throw you in,"},{"t":[197.1,198.5],"en":"because the more the merrier, right?"},{"t":[198.5,199.8],"en":"-No."},{"t":[199.8,200.9],"en":"No way."},{"t":[200.9,202.2],"en":"I am not a machine, Jim."},{"t":[202.2,204.2],"en":"You can't just change plans willy-nilly"},{"t":[204.2,207],"en":"and expect these little magic party elves to do your bidding."},{"t":[207,208.4],"en":"We already have devil's food,"},{"t":[208.4,211.6],"en":"peach cobbler, fudgie the whale, mushroom caps."},{"t":[211.6,213.2],"en":"-I'm allergic to mushrooms."},{"t":[213.2,214.1],"en":"-That's a bummer."},{"t":[214.1,217.8],"en":"-OK, then we need to..."},{"t":[217.8,218.6],"en":"-Hey, everybody."},{"t":[218.6,219.7],"en":"Hi, how you doing?"},{"t":[219.7,220.7],"en":"Could I have your attention, please?"},{"t":[220.7,223],"en":"Because we have to talk about this birthday thing."},{"t":[223,223.7],"en":"-Conference room?"},{"t":[223.7,225.3],"en":"-Yes, conference room, five minutes."},{"t":[225.3,227.5],"en":"No."},{"t":[227.5,228.4],"en":"No."},{"t":[228.4,229.5],"en":"We're going to solve it right here."},{"t":[229.5,231.3],"en":"We're going to actually talk about it out here."},{"t":[231.3,234.9],"en":"So who has problems with the birthday thing?"},{"t":[234.9,236.5],"en":"One, two, three, everybody."},{"t":[236.5,238.8],"en":"OK, so then we just shouldn't do it."},{"t":[238.8,240.9],"en":"-What am I supposed to do with two cakes and a pie?"},{"t":[240.9,242.5],"en":"-Oh, I'll take them."},{"t":[242.5,244.2],"en":"Well, nobody's touching my cobbler."},{"t":[244.2,245],"en":"-Hey, Michael."},{"t":[245,247.7],"en":"I mean, Jim."},{"t":[247.7,249.2],"en":"-Yep."},{"t":[249.2,251.8],"en":"Phyllis called me Michael."},{"t":[251.8,255],"en":"And I will always and forever be haunted by that fact."},{"t":[255,259.7],"en":"-Happy birthday to you."},{"t":[259.7,263.9],"en":"Happy birthday to you."},{"t":[263.9,269.5],"en":"Happy birthday, dear Creed."},{"t":[269.5,275],"en":"Happy birthday to you."},{"t":[275,276.4],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[276.4,277.4],"en":"All right."},{"t":[277.4,279.2],"en":"Skip around the room."},{"t":[279.2,280.8],"en":"Skip around the room."},{"t":[280.8,281.8],"en":"We won't-- OK."},{"t":[281.8,282.6],"en":"All right."},{"t":[282.6,284.1],"en":"Yeah, don't do that."},{"t":[299.5,303.9],"en":"Thank you."}]}
